{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T213014276-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": null,
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "support",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "I know you don't like it. Can we make a deal?",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:30:14.276021Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000001",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000001",
      "topic_facet": "deal",
      "topic_terms": [
        "deal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T213014277-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": null,
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "disclose",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "I think about the archaeology of myths...",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:30:14.277002Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000001",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000001",
      "topic_facet": "deal",
      "topic_terms": [
        "archaeology",
        "archaeology of myths"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T213014277-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": null,
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "But that's all I have to say this conversation. I love our back-and-forth and the fun conversation with all of you. Thanks for the fun conversation and for listening to me.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:30:14.277216Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000001",
      "beat_index": 2,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000001",
      "topic_facet": "deal",
      "topic_terms": [
        "conversation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T213229074-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T213014277-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I think we've had a perfectly good time having back-and-forth conversations, and I don't want to disrupt it. Can we try again in the near future?",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:32:29.074694Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000002",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000001",
      "topic_facet": "deal",
      "topic_terms": [
        "we've",
        "perfectly",
        "time",
        "having"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T213229075-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T213229074-owen-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "deepen",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "Can you remind me of the significance of the conversation?",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:32:29.075819Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000002",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000001",
      "topic_facet": "deal",
      "topic_terms": [
        "remind",
        "significance",
        "conversation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T213324521-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T213229075-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "I understand what significance means to them.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:33:24.521180Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000003",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000002",
      "topic_facet": "significance",
      "topic_terms": [
        "significance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T213324522-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T213229075-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I want to be taken seriously. This is my private self-state, but it's also a genuine concern. Sarah: you've been treating conversation as important (repair). I'd like you to acknowledge the situation's significance to me.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:33:24.522467Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000003",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000002",
      "topic_facet": "significance",
      "topic_terms": [
        "significance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T213324523-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T213229075-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "That significance isn't something you can handle; deal with it, and that's what we should have done from the start.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:33:24.523092Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000003",
      "beat_index": 2,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000002",
      "topic_facet": "significance",
      "topic_terms": [
        "significance",
        "deal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214111843-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T213324523-owen-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "deepen",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "Significance is like a key to unlock new doors in people's lives. They can unlock the door to potential, but sometimes it gets stuck. You have to know how to keep it open and let in new possibilities.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:41:11.843165Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000004",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000002",
      "topic_facet": "significance",
      "topic_terms": [
        "significance",
        "unlock",
        "potential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214203155-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214111843-owen-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "support",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I want to try again.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:42:03.155944Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000005",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000004",
      "topic_facet": "potential",
      "topic_terms": [
        "potential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214203157-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214111843-owen-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "I am just as interested in the potential of a meaningful outcome as you are. I am not trying to uncover a hidden assumption, but rather to explore how you perceive potential and relate to it. Can you elaborate?",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:42:03.157152Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000005",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000004",
      "topic_facet": "potential",
      "topic_terms": [
        "potential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214203157-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214203157-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "disclose",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "I value everything you're saying, but I want to make the conversation more substantial.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:42:03.157898Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000005",
      "beat_index": 2,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000004",
      "topic_facet": "potential",
      "topic_terms": [
        "value",
        "you're",
        "conversation",
        "substantial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214309857-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214203157-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "I value your feelings, but you're not really interested in changing your behavior to show that you value me.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:43:09.857686Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000006",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000004",
      "topic_facet": "potential",
      "topic_terms": [
        "your",
        "behavior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214347115-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214309857-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "I just felt really uncomfortable when you said something about me being a potential and that I'm a potential...",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:43:47.115039Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000007",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000006",
      "topic_facet": "behavior",
      "topic_terms": [
        "potential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214347116-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214347115-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I am committed to making conversation about commitment, reciprocity, and the practical stakes of the current issue.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:43:47.116704Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000007",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000006",
      "topic_facet": "behavior",
      "topic_terms": [
        "commitment",
        "reciprocity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214347117-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214347116-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I don't think it's fair to say that I'm the only one who's treated my potential as important in our conversation.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:43:47.117902Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000007",
      "beat_index": 2,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000006",
      "topic_facet": "behavior",
      "topic_terms": [
        "don't",
        "it",
        "fair",
        "i'm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214421456-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214347117-owen-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "The mechanisms of fair do not necessarily imply fairness.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:44:21.456393Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000008",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000007",
      "topic_facet": "fair",
      "topic_terms": [
        "fair",
        "mechanisms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214421458-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214421456-owen-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "What if, what if, fair, instead of just 'don't', what if you think I'd prefer don't, it, fair, too?",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:44:21.458499Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000008",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000007",
      "topic_facet": "fair",
      "topic_terms": [
        "fair",
        "what",
        "what if",
        "instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214536041-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214421458-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "{ I've taken the fairer path, that's fair, and I'd prefer not to, instead, I'll think about it, it, fair, fair.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:45:36.041287Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000009",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000007",
      "topic_facet": "fair",
      "topic_terms": [
        "fair",
        "fairer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214536043-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214421458-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "What do you really mean, Owen?",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:45:36.043724Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000009",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000007",
      "topic_facet": "fair",
      "topic_terms": [
        "fair"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214633763-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214536043-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "i didn't mean to imply anything, just had a thought on a similar problem.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:46:33.763608Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000010",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000007",
      "topic_facet": "fair",
      "topic_terms": [
        "i'm just having a thought",
        "my thought on a similar problem"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214633766-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214536043-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "What really do you mean",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:46:33.766270Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000010",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000007",
      "topic_facet": "fair",
      "topic_terms": [
        "mean"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214707874-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214633766-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "disclose",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "my thought on similar problems...",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:47:07.874924Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000011",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000010",
      "topic_facet": "similar",
      "topic_terms": [
        "similar",
        "my thought",
        "problems…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214742645-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214707874-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I think having an open and honest conversation with you is key to addressing the issue at hand",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:47:42.645135Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000012",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000011",
      "topic_facet": "having",
      "topic_terms": [
        "having",
        "open",
        "honest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214742647-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214742645-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "I'd rather just focus on something other than my thoughts and the conversation, let's explore something new.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:47:42.647856Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000012",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000011",
      "topic_facet": "having",
      "topic_terms": [
        "let's explore",
        "something other than my thoughts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214742650-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214742645-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "Have you noticed that similar, my thought, problems... are being treated in the same way by Mara too? As for me, I wonder what she means.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:47:42.650074Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000012",
      "beat_index": 2,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000011",
      "topic_facet": "having",
      "topic_terms": [
        "noticed",
        "similar",
        "problems",
        "treated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214815532-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214742650-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "support",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I remember when I was younger, I used to be able to recognize that I was treated by others as important (answer).",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:48:15.532441Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000013",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000012",
      "topic_facet": "treated",
      "topic_terms": [
        "treated",
        "important"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214815535-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214742650-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "Let's explore something other than my thoughts.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:48:15.535651Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000013",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000012",
      "topic_facet": "treated",
      "topic_terms": [
        "other"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214815538-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214815535-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I'm just having a thought...",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:48:15.538582Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000013",
      "beat_index": 2,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000012",
      "topic_facet": "treated",
      "topic_terms": [
        "thought"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214910581-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214815538-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "I appreciate your honesty, even when you're not always understanding.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:49:10.581579Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000014",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000012",
      "topic_facet": "treated",
      "topic_terms": [
        "understanding",
        "honesty"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214910585-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214815538-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "callback",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "what if people are more interested in what they want than what they say they want",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:49:10.585578Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000014",
      "beat_index": 1,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000012",
      "topic_facet": "treated",
      "topic_terms": [
        "what if",
        "what they want"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214910588-owen-v5",
      "speaker": "owen",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214815538-mara-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "I'm not sure what you want, but I'd be happy to help you explore 'what if' scenarios.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:49:10.588890Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000014",
      "beat_index": 2,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000012",
      "topic_facet": "treated",
      "topic_terms": [
        "i'm",
        "i'd",
        "happy",
        "help"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214947973-sarah-v5",
      "speaker": "sarah",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214910588-owen-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "answer",
      "target": "owen",
      "text": "I'm happy to help with your question about honesty. You seem like someone who values truthfulness and authenticity.",
      "at": "2026-09-25T21:49:47.973014Z",
      "beat_id": "beat-room-direct-reset-v6-20260925T212900Z-000015",
      "beat_index": 0,
      "topic_episode": "topic-000014",
      "topic_facet": "honesty",
      "topic_terms": [
        "honesty",
        "truthfulness"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260925T214947977-mara-v5",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": "d-20260925T214947973-sarah-v5",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "repair",
      "target": "sarah",
      "text": "I'm not interested in discussing what Owen said or what anyone else said. I need someone who will give me the facts about what really happened in this conversation.",
